# Everything the build context does not need. Keeping this tight is the
# difference between a fast build and shipping the whole working tree into the
# daemon on every change.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

.git
.github
backups
docs

# Never let a real environment file into an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.development.example

**/*.log
